                                text "PATH search for dot now requires both a regular file and effective read access before selecting a candidate. The check uses nsh-platform's safe effective-credential access wrapper, so an unreadable earlier candidate no longer prevents a later readable file from being sourced. Focused POSIX case passes and cargo test -p nsh is 262/0."
                            }
