                                    {
                                        at 2026-09-02T14:02:35.793102692Z
                                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                                        kind @note
                                        text "INTERRUPTED MID-FLIGHT 2026-09-02 ~15:0x by an API session limit, not by anything in the work. Six agents were killed in the same second. This agent held two nodes; it committed `ad00f93` (`contain-the-workspace-tests-that-run-cases`) and was on this one when it stopped.\n\nIts last words were the design question it had just reached: **zero means no budget, and must not collapse the abandonment threshold.** That is the crux and worth keeping -- `ce57a13`'s abandoned-case check defaults its age fingerprint to the wrapper's own budget, so a budget of zero would make every orphan instantly abandoned. Whoever resumes starts there.\n\nUncommitted in the checkout, not lost:\n\n    crates/nsh/tests/containment_boundary.rs   +8/-...\n    tests/harness/containment-selftest.sh      +2/-...\n\nHEAD compiles; checked in a clean detached worktree at `a81455c`.\n\nDo not `git checkout` or `git stash` either path. The tree is the only copy."
                                    }

